@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 回收站（用户侧）时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/回收站页\n(Recycle.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
database "FileRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 列表 ==
User -> UI: 打开回收站
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/recycle/bin
Axios -> FileCtrl: getRecycleBinFiles()
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: getUserRecycleBinFiles(userId)
FileSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndDeletedTrueAndOwnerHiddenFalseOrderByDeleteTimeDesc
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 [File...]
Axios --> UI: 渲染回收站文件

== 恢复 ==
User -> UI: 点击“恢复”
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/files/{fileId}/restore
Axios -> FileCtrl: restoreFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: restoreFile(fileId, userId)
FileSvc -> DB: 置 deleted=false, 清空 deleteTime
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { quotaUsed, quotaLimit }

== 彻底删除（对用户隐藏） ==
User -> UI: 点击“彻底删除”
UI -> Axios: DELETE /api/files/recycle/bin/{fileId}
Axios -> FileCtrl: permanentDeleteFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: permanentDeleteFile(fileId, userId)
FileSvc -> DB: ownerHidden=true （保留系统回收站项）
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

== 清空回收站 ==
User -> UI: 点击“清空回收站”
UI -> Axios: DELETE /api/files/recycle/bin/empty
Axios -> FileCtrl: emptyRecycleBin()
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: emptyRecycleBin(userId)
FileSvc -> DB: 批量 ownerHidden=true
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

@enduml

